  "description": "Official .NET SDK for the Payment Aggregator API. Create payment intents, confirm and capture payments, issue refunds, manage stores, list transactions, and validate payment webhooks with X-Api-Key authentication. Supports payment gateway orchestration for providers such as Stripe, PayPal, Razorpay, PayU, Cashfree, PayTabs, Telr, Mollie, Checkout.com, Adyen, Square, and Worldpay.",
